# Environment / secrets — NEVER commit
# A real .env holds credentials (JWT secrets, DB/Redis/MinIO passwords).
# Keep it local; commit a .env.example with placeholder values instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Never track third-party study material / copyrighted content
*.pdf
hello*
